<template>
  <div class="adaptive-page">
    <section v-if="phase==='setup'" class="setup-shell">
      <div class="hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">个性化训练</span><h2>难度自适应练习</h2><p>系统从1级简单题开始，根据你的表现逐步调整。先选范围，再从可行方案中挑一套。</p></div><div class="hero-level"><b>1</b><span>默认起点<br>简单</span></div></div>
